			|__ lookUpImpOrForward<span class="o">()</span>
				返回IMP结果
</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></code></pre></div></div>

<p>That’s the whole message forwarding process, which I won’t elaborate on here. If you’re interested, take a look at the message forwarding part of <a href="https://www.sunyazhou.com/2020/08/iOSinterviewAnswers2/">Chapter 2</a>.</p>

